# Server-only environment variables — this file is read by the Cloudflare
# Vite plugin as `.dev.vars` bindings (copy it to `.dev.vars`, NOT `.env`:
# nothing reads `.env`). Names are declared in src/vite-env.d.ts
# (ImportMetaEnv); never commit real values.

# MET_API_MODE=fixture
#   Pin the collection search to the committed review fixture instead of
#   the live Met API (the offline e2e/discipline default; production
#   statically sees undefined and goes live).
#   Leave unset for live-API behavior.
